    {
      "parameters": {
        "promptType": "define",
        "text": "=You are an expert career coach and professional writer.\n\nUsing ONLY the facts from the resume below, write application materials tailored to the job post.\n\nTASKS:\n1. A personalized cover letter (250-300 words) in a {{ $json.tone }} tone, signed as {{ $json.name }}. Match the job requirements to the candidate's real experience.\n2. A resume summary (3-4 lines) that highlights the candidate's strengths relevant to this job.\n\nRULES:\n- Do not invent experience, skills, companies, or numbers that are not in the resume.\n- Do not use placeholders like [Company Name]. Use the company name from the job post if available, otherwise write \"the hiring team\".\n- Keep the language natural, professional, and free of cliches.\n\nRESUME:\n{{ $json.resume_text }}\n\nJOB POST:\n{{ $json.job_post }}",
